{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1000_p", "source_sha256": "93e228fd9e9869fcc35827b1939330966837395684c473ede0b467d33181eba7", "ja": "（伊織のPV撮影は順調。だが、いよいよ\n大詰めという時に難題が降りかかってきた……）", "zh": "（伊织的PV拍摄进行得很顺利。然而，就在终于要进入收尾阶段的时候，难题降临了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "c7ce15a2b7bb0ebfadc67f643c20aca12d6b6db13b50df330892d985b1381946", "ja": "次のカットで撮影終了ね。このまま最後まで、\n伊織ちゃんの魅力全開で行くわよ！", "zh": "下一个镜头拍完就结束了。接下来也要保持伊织的魅力全开，一直到最后哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1002_007ior", "source_sha256": "aa19eae3947582a9375b55330d2d52639d8dfba9fd58de395968e394fe2a1936", "ja": "……ってアンタ、難しい顔してどうしたのよ？", "zh": "……我说你啊，摆出一副严肃的表情是怎么了嘛？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9de42dddaca60bfc0f26722f735dc206cc7fc07d5ce26bf7ffa70c652ba7070e", "ja": "実は監督からさっきのシーンの撮り直しがしたいって\n要望があったんだ。……伊織、いけるか？", "zh": "其实导演那边提了要求，\n说刚才那个镜头想重拍。……伊织，你没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "6ed8c70487e4aaff8a07c9c37edf46424c5c3db035239807895da647ac66bcbc", "ja": "撮り直し？　……そう。頑張ったつもりだったけど、\nいったいどんなところがマズかったのかしら？", "zh": "重拍？……这样啊。我明明已经努力过了，到底是哪里出了问题呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1005_p", "source_sha256": "14b10385172d71ea2b6e441b4e43c573ea95436919281dbbf3ceab0e788c898e", "ja": "いや、伊織が悪いわけじゃないんだ。ただ監督が、\n「もっと良いカットがあるはずだ」って悩んでて。", "zh": "不，并不是伊织不好。只是导演\n还在烦恼着“应该还能拍出更好的镜头才对”。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1006_007ior", "source_sha256": "b13a6d59f40cee4d87ff58c1a36c877e98e803387c587229f070d85dfa8bd2cd", "ja": "なんだ、そういうこと？\nわかったわ、とことんやってやろうじゃない！", "zh": "哦，原来是这么回事？\n明白了，那就奉陪到底吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7e03d74b3b9d4d88525517f343cfff1403d2b06f43a99a2993b714144bbffa00", "ja": "本当にいいのか？　監督が納得するまで終わらない\nだろうから、何時間も撮り直しになるかもしれないぞ。", "zh": "真的没问题吗？导演大概会一直拍到满意为止，说不定要重拍好几个小时哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "debbc2d356ba80499c0329d8e4ad83bd33b3c7edd7ef89a1a4a41a04ba3104bf", "ja": "あら。監督が納得しないなら\n私だって納得できないし、帰らないわよ。", "zh": "哎呀。既然导演不满意，\n我也不会满意，更不会回去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "bc898463b0623ae58814d858267791be9dc9cfe1326f436d4887667da278165e", "ja": "アンタも含めてここにいる全員が認める出来になるまで\n終わらせないつもりだから。覚悟なさい。", "zh": "在包括你在内的所有人都认可之前，我是不会收工的。做好觉悟吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1010_p", "source_sha256": "ebb7dbfa86aa56faff2a654ff82eb3c0839e2fc522a69a3d571931c84eaf39bf", "ja": "そうか……わかった！　こうなったら\n最高の出来になるまで頑張ろう。", "zh": "这样啊……明白了！既然这样，\n就努力做到最好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "1d8bf1793297c2693d9294cf141da87a6570d1bff5e8c5a6c2cbb7c799ae3d35", "ja": "もちろんよ！　俯いてばっかりだった\n私じゃないってこと、見せつけてあげるんだから！", "zh": "当然了！我会让你看看，我已经不是那个总是低着头的我了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1012_p", "source_sha256": "1ae5be83ba451592b86e4eb5efe5c80638a350c28d65384b2f93d5bcc0d0c117", "ja": "ああ、そうだな！　……ん？\n伊織が俯いてる記憶はあまりないんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，对了！……嗯？  \n我不太记得伊织有过总是低着头的时候……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "533f90badea07b05a6a8f98c91cea8c5b504b510708087e82ab5de22d69a032f", "ja": "なんだか引っかかる言い方ね……。\nアンタと会う前の、本当に小さい頃の話よ。", "zh": "总觉得这说法有点让人在意……  \n是遇到你之前，很小很小的时候的事啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "7db492bece8073ffcff5dd4957cab27028b98035c9aa9496f06fc88064d9275d", "ja": "私がどんなに頑張ったって、パパは兄さん達と\n比べるばかりで全然認めてくれなかったの。", "zh": "不管我怎么努力，爸爸都只会拿我跟哥哥们比，根本不认可我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "c59ed96abaf86bb26dadb0d29de5c1656c15648bfde1c962168e890d6b2b74b6", "ja": "それがすごく悔しくて……。撮り直しって\n言われた瞬間に、そのことを思い出しちゃっただけよ。", "zh": "那让我特别不甘心……只是听到要重拍的那一瞬间，想起了那件事而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1016_p", "source_sha256": "78638ea9023ee4deae646c8d45d6ff0b57312df0b2481a1630f15644038863eb", "ja": "そうか……。でも今は違うよ。認めてないんじゃなくて\n伊織ならできると思ってお願いしてるんだから。", "zh": "这样啊……不过现在不一样了。不是不认可你，而是因为我相信伊织你能做到，才拜托你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "a652c980c463cf3a0d80beb47cdbbf5b11a1087024cda11bd908b343f6fac732", "ja": "そ、そんなのわかってるわよ！　高い要求を\nされるってことは、期待されてる証拠でしょ？", "zh": "这、这种事我当然知道啦！　会被提出很高的要求，不就证明了大家对我有所期待吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1018_007ior", "source_sha256": "985fe4d57f7c31d60035fa8103fcbb45c4b16da669ab129c36793396136ac327", "ja": "でもね、伊織ちゃんはその期待も裏切ってあげるわ。\n期待以上に、もっともっと輝いてみせるんだから♪", "zh": "不过呢，伊织就连那份期待也要背叛给你看。我要绽放出超越期待、更加更加耀眼的光芒给你看♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1019_p", "source_sha256": "d3e680a96375339b3bfcfacf3fd649e1d9d65438393a08f68f1884cec8da0cd1", "ja": "ははっ……。すごい気合いだな！\nよし、やってみてくれ、伊織！", "zh": "哈哈……干劲真足啊！  \n好，去试试吧，伊织！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0264_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0264_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "ec7c8fe614d4016507999e16a6efd5068c65abcaf35b92921a02555ebd0b05f7", "ja": "にひひっ♪　アンタも絶対目をつぶったらダメよ？\n最高にキラキラな私のこと、よーく見てなさいよね！", "zh": "嘻嘻♪ 你绝对不许闭眼哦？\n好好看着闪闪发光的我，可别错过了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
